      "source": "linkedin",
      "description": "Reason to join us:\n• We offer the opportunity to work in a highly professional environment where you will work with high-level financial instruments\n• We want you to be part of our success story and give you reasons to be proud of what you achieved as part of our fabulous team\n• We allow you to develop yourself and evolve in your career via our fantastic technical, business-related, or soft-skills training\n• We encourage creative thinking in our great open-minded work environment. Frequently the relaxation rooms are the place where the most ambitious ideas are born.\n• We are not just professional teams, we are also friends who have fun working together\n• If you are an active person and you feel motivated by the creation/development of software solutions, then this is the place to be, you will not get bored.\nProject description:\nVR-120329\nThe client, an investment bank is renewing its workflow automation technology. The project it's a new platform aiming at simplifying business process interactions and automation by using modern technologies specific to this domain.\nThe core of the platform is managing all platform business processes and providing core functionalities, libraries, indexing, data enhancement, and user interaction to onboarded use cases. The goal is to have high availability and high-performance platform infrastructure with a focus on fast business adoption with low downtimes. Core technologies are Java, Camunda, Spring, Hibernate, and Elasticsearch deployed on OpenShift/Kubernetes environments and automated by E2E CI/CD pipelines.\nResponsibilities:\nAbility to plan and implement the full set of test automation activities: create, maintain, and execute automated tests.\nDevelop, extend, and improve the existing Test Automation tools and test frameworks\nProviding input to the project plan/release plan, defect/change management processes, systems integration, testing tools and processes;\nIdentifying areas of weakness to 